<title>POLAND: OCEAN OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 ML.</title>
<headline>OCEAN OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.1 ML.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.12 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.20 vs   0.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.19 vs   0.11</p>
<p> Sales		    2.87 vs   2.03</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.23 vs   0.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.11 vs   1.19</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.13 vs   1.13</p>
<p> Sales		   28.59 vs  22.31</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler and retailer is Ocean</p>
<p>Company SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
